<title>BELGIUM: Brantano starts bourse trade up 2.7 pct.</title>
<headline>Brantano starts bourse trade up 2.7 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-06-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Belgian shoe distributor Brantano began bourse trade on Monday at 1,150 francs, 2.7 percent up on their price in an intial public offering that closed last week.</p>
</text>
